# Bloodmoon "Supply Route Problems", Falco's side: the new supply ship's
# captain, Baro Egnatius, wants extra payment. Apronia gives the player
# Elberoth's saber; Baro, seeing it drawn within 512 units (ColonyBaro's
# saberout), thinks the player killed Elberoth and backs down. EquipItem and
# SetAlert stand in for the player drawing the saber.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_setting_up_shop --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case co_supply_route
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask assignment
ask extra payment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 20
bye
run
player->Position -199000 156900 300 0
until 600 "Baro Egnatius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Baro Egnatius
ask extra payment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 30
bye
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask extra payment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 40
bye
until 600 "Apronia Alfena"->GetDistance player < 1500
talk Apronia Alfena
ask Elberoth
ask his saber
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 50
bye
talk Falco Galenus
ask Elberoth
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 55
bye
run
player->Position -199000 156900 300 0
until 600 "Baro Egnatius"->GetDistance player < 400
console player.equipitem 0641C122
console player.setalert 1
until 600 "Baro Egnatius".saberout == 1
talk Baro Egnatius
ask his saber
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 60
bye
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask extra payment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_5 == 80
bye
end
